# Environment Variables — Ashley M. Brows

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your actual values.
Never commit `.env.local` to git (it is already in .gitignore).

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# SUPABASE
# Get these from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGci...your-anon-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# STRIPE (Frontend - Publishable Key ONLY)
# Get from: Stripe Dashboard → Developers → API Keys
# NEVER put your Secret Key here — it belongs only in Supabase Edge Function secrets.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_...your-stripe-publishable-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# STRIPE & SUPABASE SECRET KEYS
# These DO NOT go here. They are set via:
#   supabase secrets set STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
#   supabase secrets set STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
#   supabase secrets set SITE_URL=https://ashleymbrows.netlify.app
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
